  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Capacity of Regulatory Reform Unit ot the Armenian Government</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims strengthening capacity at the Regulatory Reform Unit with the goal of performing Regulatory Guillotine through inventory and revision of those legal norms that affect businesses and citizens, and eliminate or simplify those that are not needed or business friendly. This reform will substantially reduce the costs of regulations affecting businesses and citizens and, as a result, expected to raise the public sector efficiency and to reduce corruption risks.  TF011972</narrative>
  </description>
